{"task_id": "12fba6b7962e75bb", "model_key": "openai-gpt-6-1-terra", "raw_response": "Let \\(E_i\\) denote the \\(i\\)-th equation. Row reduction modulo \\(7\\) gives\n\\[\n(x_1,\\ldots,x_8)\\equiv(5,0,3,0,3,4,2,6)\\pmod 7.\n\\]\n\nModulo \\(5\\), the original equations give\n\\[\n(x_1,\\ldots,x_8)\\equiv\n(1,2,3,1+t,3-t,1-t,2t,t)\\pmod 5.\n\\]\nTo determine \\(t\\), the integer combination\n\\[\n\\frac{2E_2+2E_3+E_4+2E_5+2E_7+4E_8}{5}\n\\]\ngives\n\\[\n-28x_1-2x_2-7x_3-38x_4-21x_6+30x_7+9x_8=597.\n\\]\nReducing this equation modulo \\(5\\) yields \\(t=2\\).\n\nCombining the congruences gives a centered representative\n\\[\n(-9,7,3,-7,-4,4,9,-8).\n\\]\nDirect substitution produces the right-hand sides\n\\[\n(167,-204,839,511,-408,-423,440,285),\n\\]\nso this representative is the unique solution.\n\n{\"answer\": [-9, 7, 3, -7, -4, 4, 9, -8]}", "parsed_answer": "[-9, 7, 3, -7, -4, 4, 9, -8]", "correct": true, "parse_status": "correct", "error": null, "latency_ms": 176323, "usage": {"input": 581, "output": 9647, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 9322, "totalTokens": 10228, "cost": {"input": 0.000581, "output": 0.04823500000000001, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.048816000000000005}}, "cost_usd": 0.048816000000000005, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "openai", "model": "gpt-6.1-terra", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "resp_09bf1178324632ed016ae4820e7f5087d099345d00a29373a3"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-30T11:39:57+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-30T11:42:53+00:00"}
