{"task_id": "0ee324363338389f", "model_key": "openai-gpt-6-1-terra", "raw_response": "I could not determine the full list of 30 integers reliably. As a partial check, reducing the first equation modulo 2 gives\n\\[\nx_1+x_2+x_3+x_4+x_7+x_8+x_{10}+x_{11}+x_{12}+x_{14}\n+x_{15}+x_{18}+x_{20}+x_{22}+x_{24}+x_{25}+x_{26}+x_{27}\n\\equiv 0 \\pmod 2.\n\\]\n\nThe following Python script uses exact fraction-free elimination and will print the requested JSON if the 30 equation lines are supplied on standard input:\n\n```python\nimport json\nimport re\nimport sys\nfrom fractions import Fraction\n\nn = 30\nmatrix = []\n\nfor line in sys.stdin:\n    if \"=\" not in line or not re.search(r\"x\\d+\", line):\n        continue\n    lhs, rhs = line.split(\"=\", 1)\n    row = [0] * (n + 1)\n    for sign, coefficient, index in re.findall(\n        r\"([+-]?)\\s*(?:(\\d+)\\s*\\*\\s*)?x(\\d+)\", lhs\n    ):\n        value = int(coefficient or 1)\n        row[int(index) - 1] += -value if sign == \"-\" else value\n    row[n] = int(rhs.strip())\n    matrix.append(row)\n\nassert len(matrix) == n\n\nprevious_pivot = 1\nfor k in range(n - 1):\n    pivot_row = next(i for i in range(k, n) if matrix[i][k])\n    matrix[k], matrix[pivot_row] = matrix[pivot_row], matrix[k]\n    pivot = matrix[k][k]\n\n    for i in range(k + 1, n):\n        entry = matrix[i][k]\n        for j in range(k + 1, n + 1):\n            numerator = pivot * matrix[i][j] - entry * matrix[k][j]\n            quotient, remainder = divmod(numerator, previous_pivot)\n            assert remainder == 0\n            matrix[i][j] = quotient\n        matrix[i][k] = 0\n    previous_pivot = pivot\n\nsolution = [Fraction(0)] * n\nfor i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n    remainder = Fraction(matrix[i][n]) - sum(\n        matrix[i][j] * solution[j] for j in range(i + 1, n)\n    )\n    solution[i] = remainder / matrix[i][i]\n\nassert all(value.denominator == 1 for value in solution)\nprint(json.dumps({\"answer\": [value.numerator for value in solution]}))\n```\n\n{\"answer\": null}", "parsed_answer": null, "correct": false, "parse_status": "unparseable", "error": "could not find a complete list of integers", "latency_ms": 169872, "usage": {"input": 4697, "output": 9156, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 8578, "totalTokens": 13853, "cost": {"input": 0.004697, "output": 0.04578, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.050477}}, "cost_usd": 0.050477, "attempts": 1, "model_info": {"provider": "openai", "model": "gpt-6.1-terra", "api": "openai-responses", "thinkingLevel": "max", "responseId": "resp_05530fd96d746e3d016ae4b452483887d0a4667ed43d46f1f6"}, "stop_reason": "stop", "started_at": "2026-10-30T15:14:24+00:00", "finished_at": "2026-10-30T15:17:13+00:00"}
